* SYNTHETIC SAMPLE - written for the Diocle hackathon project.
* CUSTOMER HIERARCHY: CUSTROOT > ACCTSEG > TXNSEG, CUSTROOT > ADDRSEG,
* ACCTSEG > CARDSEG. SEGMENT LAYOUTS ARE IN QMK.PROD.IMS.COPYLIB.
         DBD   NAME=QMKCUSDB,ACCESS=(HIDAM,VSAM)
         DATASET DD1=QMKCUSD,DEVICE=3390
         SEGM  NAME=CUSTROOT,PARENT=0,BYTES=64
         FIELD NAME=(CUSTKEY,SEQ,U),BYTES=7,START=1,TYPE=C
         SEGM  NAME=ADDRSEG,PARENT=CUSTROOT,BYTES=80
         SEGM  NAME=ACCTSEG,PARENT=CUSTROOT,BYTES=40
         FIELD NAME=(ACCTKEY,SEQ,U),BYTES=10,START=1,TYPE=C
         SEGM  NAME=CARDSEG,PARENT=ACCTSEG,BYTES=32
         SEGM  NAME=TXNSEG,PARENT=ACCTSEG,BYTES=48
         DBDGEN
         FINISH
         END
